{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2023-04-27 16:05:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS RELEASES FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS', 'text': "MELBOURNE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LHX) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FIRST QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2023 RESULTS IN AN INVESTOR LETTER POSTED TO THE INVESTOR RELATIONS SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE. L3HARRIS CHAIR & CEO CHRIS KUBASIK AND CFO MICHELLE TURNER WILL HOST AN APPROXIMATELY 45-MINUTE CALL ON APRIL 28, 2023, AT 8:30 A.M. ET FOCUSED ON QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS. TO ACCESS THE TELECONFERENCE, PARTICIPANTS IN THE U.S. MAY CALL 877-407-6184, WHILE INTERNATIONAL PARTICIPANT."}